{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/called-in-decision-land-surrounding-ebbsfleet-united-football-club-stonebridge-road-northfleet-ref-3360355-30-july-2026","content_id":"bb4c3e72-7984-407e-9638-11e63b227d3c","description":"Decision letter and Inspector’s Report for a called-in application.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a6b55060c36759b5ccaa24e","filename":"260730_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC_-_Ebbsfleet_Football_Club_-_3360355.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":5445244,"filename":"260730_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC_-_Ebbsfleet_Football_Club_-_3360355.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9423516","isbn":"","number_of_pages":213,"title":"Called-in decision: land surrounding Ebbsfleet United Football Club, Stonebridge Road, Northfleet (ref: 3360355 - 30 July 2026)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6b55060c36759b5ccaa24e/260730_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC_-_Ebbsfleet_Football_Club_-_3360355.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Decision letter and Inspector’s Report for a called-in application for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>outline planning application with all matters reserved, except for the primary means of access and road layout, for a phased mixed-use redevelopment involving the Demolition of existing buildings and structures including site preparation / remediation works </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>the development of residential units (Use Class C3), Class E uses including floorspace for retail Class E(a)), food/beverage and drinking establishments (Use Class E(b)), local services (Use Class E(c)), indoor sport / recreation / fitness (use Class E(d)), healthcare space (Use Class E(e)), creche / nursery uses (Use Class E(f)), office floorspace (Use Class E(g)(i)); a new multi-use stadium with associated business and leisure facilities (sui generis), hotel (Use Class C1), community uses floorspace (Use Class F2)</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>the phased redevelopment will include other sui generis uses; delivery of open space and significant realignment of the road network including the A226 Galley Hill Road / Stonebridge Road / Lower Road with hard / soft landscaping, car and cycle parking provisions, infrastructure works, ancillary and associated works.</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-30T15:30:01Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9423516"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-30T16:30:01.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-30T16:30:01+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/called-in-decision-land-surrounding-ebbsfleet-united-football-club-stonebridge-road-northfleet-ref-3360355-30-july-2026","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/called-in-decision-land-surrounding-ebbsfleet-united-football-club-stonebridge-road-northfleet-ref-3360355-30-july-2026","base_path":"/government/publications/called-in-decision-land-surrounding-ebbsfleet-united-football-club-stonebridge-road-northfleet-ref-3360355-30-july-2026","content_id":"bb4c3e72-7984-407e-9638-11e63b227d3c","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-30T15:30:01Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Called-in decision